---
import TraversyLabLinks from '../../components/TraversyLabLinks.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Traversy Lab terms of use"
  description="Terms for Brad Traversy's private Traversy Lab automation system."
  pageTitle="terms.md"
  currentSection="legal"
>
  <TraversyLabLinks />

  <section class="section">
    <h1 class="h1"><span class="hash"># </span>Traversy Lab terms of use</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      These terms apply to Traversy Lab, Brad Traversy's private personal
      automation system.
    </p>
    <p class="meta">Effective: October 15, 2026</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="h2"><span class="hash">## </span>private use</h2>
    <p>
      Traversy Lab is not a public service. Access is limited to Brad and to
      Google accounts that he owns or is authorized to connect. There is no
      public account registration, paid plan, or service commitment.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="h2"><span class="hash">## </span>authorized accounts</h2>
    <p>
      A Google account may be connected only by its owner or by someone who has
      authority to grant access. Access must not be used to read another
      person's data without permission.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="h2"><span class="hash">## </span>Google services</h2>
    <p>
      Use of Google services remains subject to Google's own terms, policies,
      and account controls. Google is not responsible for Traversy Lab and does
      not endorse it.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="h2"><span class="hash">## </span>availability</h2>
    <p>
      Traversy Lab is provided for personal use as available. Workflows may be
      changed, paused, or discontinued at any time. No guarantee is made that a
      workflow will always be available, accurate, or error-free.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="h2"><span class="hash">## </span>changes and contact</h2>
    <p>
      These terms may be updated when the system or its use changes. Questions
      can be sent to{' '}
      <a href="mailto:travxlabs@gmail.com" class="link">travxlabs@gmail.com</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <div class="comment">
    // EOF terms.md<span class="cursor"></span>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .meta {
    margin-top: 12px;
    color: var(--fg-comment);
    font-size: 12.5px;
  }
</style>
